<title>UK: EMAP buys France's Golf Magazine.</title>
<headline>EMAP buys France's Golf Magazine.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>British media group EMAP Plc said on Friday it bought French monthly &quot;Golf Magazine&quot; from publishers BC Editions.</p>
<p>EMAP, which already has extensive interests in France, said it had acquired the title and goodwill but no net assets of the magazine with a monthly circulation of over 41,000.</p>
<p>It said Golf Magazine's turnover totalled around 20 million francs and said golf was a growth market in France with just 500 golf courses supporting 300,000 golfers.</p>
<p>--London Newsroom +44 171 542 4019</p>
